                    <h2 class="sub">                    Multi-Pattern Condenser Microphone</h2>
                    <p>The GXL3000BP is a multipattern FET condenser, offering switchable pickup patterns: cardioid, omni, figure-of-8.</p><p>The CAD GXL3000BP was released in 2011 to mark the 10th anniversary of CAD&#8217;s best selling GXL line of microphones.</p><blockquote><p><cite>CAD Press Release July 2011</cite></p><p>The versatile new GXL1200BP, GXL2200BP and GXL3000BP condenser mics all feature a lustrous black pearl chrome finish along with exceptional performance specs that allow the mics to stand out in a range of studio and live sound reinforcement applications.</p></blockquote><p>According to the published specifications, aside from the new black pearl finish, the 3000BP is identical to the original.</p><p>See <a href="http://recordinghacks.com/microphones/CAD/GXL3000" target="blank">CAD GXL3000</a> for more details.<p>The <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/CAD/GXL3000BP">CAD Audio GXL3000BP</a> is also known as: GXL-3000BP.</p><p>The mic was released in 2011.</p>
